play:table-caption!important}body.skin--responsive .mw-parser-output .infobox-table>tbody{display:table-row-group}body.skin--responsive .mw-parser-output .infobox-table th,body.skin--responsive .mw-parser-output .infobox-table td{padding-left:inherit;padding-right:inherit}}</style><style data-mw-deduplicate=\"TemplateStyles:r1315121714\">.mw-parser-output .ib-election{line-height:1.5em}.mw-parser-output .ib-election .infobox-data{text-align:center}.mw-parser-output .ib-election .infobox-label{width:5em;white-space:nowrap}.mw-parser-output .ib-election .infobox-subheader{line-height:130%}.mw-parser-output .ib-election .infobox-header{font-weight:normal}@media(max-width:640px){body.skin--responsive:not(.skin-monobook):not(.skin-timeless) .mw-parser-output .ib-election .notpageimage.noresize img{height:80px!important;width:auto!important}}@media screen{html.skin-theme-clientpref-night .mw-parser-output .ib-election .mw-file-description img{background-color:#f8f9fa;color:inherit}}@media screen and (prefers-color-scheme:dark){html.skin-theme-clientpref-os .mw-parser-output .ib-election .mw-file-description img{background-color:#f8f9fa;color:inherit}}</style><style data-mw-deduplicate=\"TemplateStyles:r1152813436\">.mw-parser-output .sr-only{border:0;clip:rect(0,0,0,0);clip-path:polygon(0px 0px,0px 0px,0px 0px);height:1px;margin:-1px;overflow:hidden;padding:0;position:absolute;width:1px;white-space:nowrap}</style><table class=\"infobox ib-election infobox-table\"><caption class=\"infobox-title summary\">2027 local electoral calendar</caption><tbody><tr><td colspan=\"2\" class=\"infobox-subheader\"><div style=\"width:100%\"><div style=\"float: left; text-align:left;padding-right:0.5em;width:20%;\" class=\"noprint\">&#8592;&#160;<a href=\"/wiki/2026_local_electoral_calendar\" title=\"2026 local electoral calendar\">2026</a></div><div style=\"float: right; text-align:right;padding-left:0.5em;width:20%;\" class=\"noprint\"><i>2028</i>&#160;&#8594;</div></div></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\" class=\"infobox-full-data\">\n<table style=\"background:transparent; color: inherit; width:100%;\">\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n</table></td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p>This <b>local electoral calendar for 2027</b> lists the subnational elections scheduled to be held in 2027. <a href=\"/wiki/Referendum\" title=\"Referendum\">Referendums</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Recall_election\" title=\"Recall election\">recall</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Retention_election\" title=\"Retention election\">retention elections</a>, and national <a href=\"/wiki/By-election\" title=\"By-election\">by-elections (special elections)</a> are also included. Specific dates are given where these are known.\n</p>\n<meta property=\"mw:PageProp/toc\" />\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading2\"><h2 id=\"January\">January</h2><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=2027_local_electoral_calendar&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: January\"><span>edit</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading2\"><h2 id=\"February\">February</h2><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=2027_local_electoral_calendar&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: February\"><span>edit</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<ul><li>23 February: <a href=\"/wiki/Elections_in_the_United_States\" title=\"Elections in the United States\">United States</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/2027_Chicago_mayoral_election\" title=\"2027 Chicago mayoral election\">2027 Chicago mayoral election</a></li></ul>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading2\"><h2 id=\"March\">March</h2><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=2027_local_electoral_calendar&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: March\"><span>edit</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<ul><li>7 March: <a href=\"/wiki/2027_Lithuanian_municipal_elections\" title=\"2027 Lithuanian municipal elections\">2027 Lithuanian municipal elections</a></li>\n<li>11 March: <a href=\"/wiki/Elections_in_Nigeria\" title=\"Elections in Nigeria\">Nigeria</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Oyo_State\" title=\"Oyo State\">Oyo State</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/2027_Oyo_State_gubernatorial_election\" title=\"2027 Oyo State gubernatorial election\">Governor</a></li>\n<li>13 March: <a href=\"/wiki/2027_New_South_Wales_state_election\" title=\"2027 New South Wales state election\">2027 New South Wales state election</a><sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-NSWWahl&#95;1-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-NSWWahl-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup></li></ul>\n<ul><li>17 March: <a href=\"/w/index.php?title=2027_Dutch_provincial_elections&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2027 Dutch provincial elections (page does not exist)\">2027 Dutch provincial elections</a><sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-2\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-2\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>2<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup></li></ul>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading2\"><h2 id=\"April\">April</h2><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=2027_local_electoral_calendar&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: April\"><span>edit</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<ul><li>18 April:\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/2027_Saarland_state_election\" title=\"2027 Saarland state election\">2027 Saarland state election</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/2027_Schleswig-Holstein_state_election\" title=\"2027 Schleswig-Holstein state election\">2027 Schleswig-Holstein state election</a></li></ul></li>\n<li>25 April: <a href=\"/wiki/2027_North_Rhine-Westphalia_state_election\" title=\"2027 North Rhine-Westphalia state election\">2027 North Rhine-Westphalia state election</a></li></ul>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading2\"><h2 id=\"May\">May</h2><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=2027_local_electoral_calendar&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: May\"><span>edit</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<ul><li>7 May: <a href=\"/wiki/2027_United_Kingdom_local_elections\" title=\"2027 United Kingdom local elections\">2027 United Kingdom local elections</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Next_Northern_Ireland_Assembly_election\" title=\"Next Northern Ireland Assembly election\">2027 Northern Ireland Assembly election</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=2027_Northern_Ireland_local_elections&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2027 Northern Ireland local elections (page does not exist)\">2027 Northern Ireland local elections</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/2027_Scottish_local_elections\" title=\"2027 Scottish local elections\">2027 Scottish local elections</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/2027_Welsh_local_elections\" title=\"2027 Welsh local elections\">2027 Welsh local elections</a></li></ul></li>\n<li>23 May:\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/2027_Spanish_regional_elections\" title=\"2027 Spanish regional elections\">2027 Spanish regional elections</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/2027_Asturian_regional_election\" title=\"2027 Asturian regional election\">2027 Asturian regional election</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Next_Balearic_regional_election\" title=\"Next Balearic regional election\">2027 Balearic regional election</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Next_Canarian_regional_election\" title=\"Next Canarian regional election\">2027 Canarian regional election</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/2027_Cantabrian_regional_election\" title=\"2027 Cantabrian regional election\">2027 Cantabrian regional election</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/2027_Castilian-Manchegan_regional_election\" title=\"2027 Castilian-Manchegan regional election\">2027 Castilian-Manchegan regional election</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/2027_Riojan_regional_election\" title=\"2027 Riojan regional election\">2027 Riojan regional election</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/2027_Madrilenian_regional_election\" title=\"2027 Madrilenian regional election\">2027 Madrilenian regional election</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/2027_Murcian_regional_election\" title=\"2027 Murcian regional election\">2027 Murcian regional election</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/2027_Navarrese_regional_election\" title=\"2027 Navarrese regional election\">2027 Navarrese regional election</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Next_Valencian_regional_election\" title=\"Next Valencian regional election\">2027 Valencian regional election</a></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/2027_Spanish_local_elections\" title=\"2027 Spanish local elections\">2027 Spanish local elections</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/2027_Barcelona_municipal_election\" title=\"2027 Barcelona municipal election\">2027 Barcelona municipal election</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/2027_Madrid_municipal_election\" title=\"2027 Madrid municipal election\">2027 Madrid municipal election</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/2027_Seville_municipal_election\" title=\"2027 Seville municipal election\">2027 Seville municipal election</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/2027_Valencia_municipal_election\" title=\"2027 Valencia municipal election\">2027 Valencia municipal election</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/2027_Zaragoza_municipal_election\" title=\"2027 Zaragoza municipal election\">2027 Zaragoza municipal election</a></li></ul></li></ul></li>\n<li>30 May: <a href=\"/wiki/2027_Bremen_state_election\" title=\"2027 Bremen state election\">2027 Bremen state election</a></li></ul>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading2\"><h2 id=\"June\">June</h2><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=2027_local_electoral_calendar&amp;action=edit&amp;section=6\" title=\"Edit section: June\"><span>edit</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<ul><li>6 June: <a href=\"/wiki/Elections_in_Cambodia\" title=\"Elections in Cambodia\">Cambodia</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/2027_Cambodian_communal_elections\" title=\"2027 Cambodian communal elections\">communal elections</a><sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-3\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-3\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>3<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup></li>\n<li>6 June: <a href=\"/wiki/Elections_in_Mexico\" title=\"Elections in Mexico\">Mexico</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/2027_Mexican_local_elections\" title=\"2027 Mexican local elections\">state elections</a><sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-4\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-4\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>4<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup></li></ul>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading2\"><h2 id=\"July\">July</h2><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=2027_local_electoral_calendar&amp;action=edit&amp;section=7\" title=\"Edit section: July\"><span>edit</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading2\"><h2 id=\"August\">August</h2><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=2027_local_electoral_calendar&amp;action=edit&amp;section=8\" title=\"Edit section: August\"><span>edit</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading2\"><h2 id=\"September\">September</h2><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=2027_local_electoral_calendar&amp;action=edit&amp;section=9\" title=\"Edit section: September\"><span>edit</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<ul><li>26 September: <a href=\"/wiki/2027_Lower_Saxony_state_election\" title=\"2027 Lower Saxony state election\">2027 Lower Saxony state election</a></li></ul>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading2\"><h2 id=\"October\">October</h2><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=2027_local_electoral_calendar&amp;action=edit&amp;section=10\" title=\"Edit section: October\"><span>edit</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<ul><li>5 October: <a href=\"/wiki/44th_Manitoba_general_election\" title=\"44th Manitoba general election\">2027 Manitoba general election</a><sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-ElectionsManitoba&#95;5-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-ElectionsManitoba-5\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>5<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup></li></ul>\n<ul><li>5 October: <a href=\"/wiki/2027_Northwest_Territories_general_election\" title=\"2027 Northwest Territories general election\">2027 Northwest Territories general election</a><sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-ElectionsNWT&#95;6-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-ElectionsNWT-6\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>6<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup></li></ul>\n<ul><li>17 October: <a href=\"/w/index.php?title=2027_%C3%85landic_legislative_election&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2027 Ålandic legislative election (page does not exist)\">2027 Ålandic legislative election</a><sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-AlandWahl&#95;7-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-AlandWahl-7\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>7<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup></li></ul>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading2\"><h2 id=\"November\">November</h2><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=2027_local_electoral_calendar&amp;action=edit&amp;section=11\" title=\"Edit section: November\"><span>edit</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<ul><li>2 November: <a href=\"/wiki/Elections_in_the_United_States\" title=\"Elections in the United States\">United States</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/2027_United_States_elections\" title=\"2027 United States elections\">off-year elections</a></li></ul>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading2\"><h2 id=\"December\">December</h2><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=2027_local_electoral_calendar&amp;action=edit&amp;section=12\" title=\"Edit section: December\"><span>edit</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading2\"><h2 id=\"Unknown_date\">Unknown date</h2><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=2027_local_electoral_calendar&amp;action=edit&amp;section=13\" title=\"Edit section: Unknown date\"><span>edit</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading3\"><h3 id=\"Austria\">Austria</h3><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=2027_local_electoral_calendar&amp;action=edit&amp;section=14\" title=\"Edit section: Austria\"><span>edit</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/2027_Tyrolean_state_election\" title=\"2027 Tyrolean state election\">2027 Tyrolean state election</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=2027_Upper_Austrian_state_election&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2027 Upper Austrian state election (page does not exist)\">2027 Upper Austrian state election</a></li></ul>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading3\"><h3 id=\"Canada\">Canada</h3><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=2027_local_electoral_calendar&amp;action=edit&amp;section=15